unner occupancy, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]actionable recovery guidance in either human or stable JSON form.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase/repos/plans/202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]axe_status.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Portable AXE runtime status contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]axe-status-domain[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Define the portable AXE runtime status contract\" section: add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Rust-owned status wire, deterministic classifier, PyO3 binding, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exhaustive domain tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Side-effect-free host status snapshot[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]axe-status-snapshot[dim] · [dim][/dim]after axe-status-domain[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Collect one side-effect-free host snapshot\" section: collect [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]authoritative Python host signals, call the shared classifier, tolerate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]races, and align deep doctor with the snapshot.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Polished AXE status CLI and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]axe-status-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after axe-status-snapshot[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"Ship the polished CLI, automation contract, and docs\" section: register[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and render the human/JSON command, enforce exit semantics, test terminal[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]layouts, and document the feature.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-8t","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-